Here is a complete HTML file that recreates a pixel-perfect Space Invaders game, inspired by the original 1978 Taito cabinet.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Space Invaders · 1978 Taito</title>
  <style>
    /* === CRT & cabinet styling === */
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      background-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #0a0a1a 0%, #000 100%);
    }
    .cabinet {
      background: #2a1a0e;
      border: 8px solid #3a2a1a;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 20px 30px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 0 20px #5a3a1a;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .crt {
      background: #0f0f1a;
      border: 4px solid #1f1f2a;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px #000, 0 0 10px #3f3f5a;
    }
